[node name="RichTextLabel2" parent="Camera/Email" index="7" unique_id=24024372 instance=ExtResource("3_2rjx8")]
text = "GUYS !

What the hell happened on Level 07 ? It's like a storm unleashed here !

I know we don't have any surprise inspection 'til next quarter but still, this is unacceptable. We literally have to climb on crates and ladders to reach the next door. This is not safe.

Eric Eccert
Executive Operational Team Manager


PS: We are preparing a little party for Amy's return, if anyone is interested. (There will probably be cake).
"

